>>>>>>
>>>>>> cd lib/stan_math
>>>>>> git pull —ff
>>>>>> cd ../..
>>>>>> git pull —ff
>>>>>>
>>>>>> In other word, fast forward merges (git pull -ff) aren’t recursive so if there are
>>>>>> conflicts in the submodules then you’ll have to fix them yourself.
